      - "EFFICIENCY, important — REFUTED BY THE VERIFIER, THEN FOUND REAL. ui/src/BodyViewer.tsx passed both value={shownText()} and getPayload={shownText} to CopyButton; getPayload wins at click time (CopyButton.tsx:38), so value only seeds useConfirm's resetKey while decoding the whole body on every render. The verifier probed CopyButton in ISOLATION, found that dropping value leaves resetKey undefined forever, and called the prop load-bearing for the confirm reset. That is true of the component and false at this call site: every mode or leg change runs setFetched(null) (BodyViewer.tsx:69), which makes `loaded` null and unmounts the entire action group — so the confirm is destroyed by unmount, with or without value. Established the only way that settles it: the prop was deleted and the suite stayed green, which proved the test written to guard it could not fail and so was not evidence. Fixed in c46ae76 — the prop is gone and the test now asserts the invariant that actually holds."
